These 40 files are NOT covered by the license of the rest of this
repository. They are a derivative work and carry their own terms.

Original artwork
  Basquetteur, via Wikimedia Commons
  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Spanish_playing_cards

Distributed as SVG by
