Changes made
  The source SVGs were rasterized to WebP at 329x520. Nothing else was
  altered: no retouch, no recolour, no crop. The exact recipe is
  ../tools/process-svg-deck.mjs.

ShareAlike
  Because rasterizing is an adaptation, these WebP files are themselves
  licensed CC BY-SA 3.0. Anyone redistributing them must keep this notice,
  credit Basquetteur, link the license, and state that changes were made.
  The attribution the product itself shows lives in ../src/about.ts.
